{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">建滔積層板發盈喜，預計上半年盈利按年增長逾2倍，超過28億元。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">主要由於覆銅面板及其上游物料產品單價明顯上升，以及覆銅面板銷量增長所致。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-30T23:39:07.100885+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":68,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}